      "notebook_entry": "The still-connected manual-discharge circuit occupied the same cable-riser work area as the network remediation.",
      "reinterprets": "E-001. The connected circuit stops being an isolated maintenance oddity and becomes physically relevant to the work being performed.",
      "source_order": 21
    },
    {
      "id": "E-022",
      "statement": "Suppression diagnostics recorded a manual-release input at the time of the Halon discharge rather than a release initiated by fire detection.",
      "physical_items_description": "Suppression event diagnostic panel + environmental event log",
      "physical_item_ids": [
        "P-037",
        "P-103",
        "P-114"
      ],
      "location": "Server Room / Facilities evidence",
