      "collection_ids": [
        "TS-18"
      ],
      "act": "Act III: Resolution",
      "importance": "Core resolution",
      "notebook_entry": "Disturbance of the still-connected manual-discharge circuit during Server Room cable work generated the Halon release input.",
      "reinterprets": "E-001, E-008, E-018, E-020, E-021 and E-022. What initially looked like a collection of unrelated closure issues resolves into an accidental interaction between routine network remediation and a suppression circuit that remained legitimately connected.",
      "source_order": 23
